T integration. The median one month retention rate for gen-AI apps is 42%. 11- to 17-year-olds receive at least 237 notifications every day. Disney+ lost 11.7 million subscribers in the last quarter. 40% of Gen Z reports having a close friend who they interact with only online. Blue Apron is set to be acquired by Wonder Group for a 95% discount. Uber drivers in Brazil are using the app StopClub to calculate the cost of pick-ups.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7da1c396333dfed0ca86fb42c873226d?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-10-05T16:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"hwmPnVGuk","title":"Department of Product","url":"https://www.departmentofproduct.com/newsletter/product-briefing-september-28-2023/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/department-of-product-hwmpnvguk","summary":"Spotify has unveiled a new feature called Voice Translation, Microsoft is developing its own in-house rival to OpenAI, and GA alternative June announced new features.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7da1c396333dfed0ca86fb42c873226d?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-28T16:26:00.000Z"},{"id":"crdgibTtO","title":"Department of Product","url":"https://www.departmentofproduct.com/newsletter/product-briefing-september-21-2023/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/department-of-product-crdgibtto","summary":"The Department of Product shares updates on TimeOS, Google Bard Extensions, Jimo, and other product-related news and tools.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7da1c396333dfed0ca86fb42c873226d?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-21T16:23:00.000Z"},{"id":"bJZ0OfL5I","title":"Department of Product","url":"https://www.departmentofproduct.com/newsletter/product-briefing-september-14-2023/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/department-of-product-bjz0ofl5i","summary":"A new product called Permit helps product teams implement permissions easily. Retool AI allows product teams to quickly implement AI features. Uber is rumored to be launching a competitor to TaskRabbit.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7da1c396333dfed0ca86fb42c873226d?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-14T16:08:00.000Z"}],"top_posts":[{"id":"5Uc00Ebfa","title":"Alternative Product Business Models","url":"https://www.departmentofproduct.com/blog/alternative-product-business-models/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/alternative-product-business-models-5uc00ebfa","summary":"The world, as always, is changing \u2013 and keeping on top of trends that matter to product teams is an essential part of succeeding in building winning products. In our previous discussion on the topic of trends, we broadly categorised important trend shifts into 3 different groups: Technical trends, Business trends, Design trends and Design trends.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a11205516d22e5ca8c61e85cf19a0892","num_upvotes":5,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-29T14:38:01.000Z"},{"id":"ICAyecRWC","title":"How to Write Tasks for Usability Testing","url":"https://www.departmentofproduct.com/blog/how-to-write-tasks-for-usability-testing/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-write-tasks-for-usability-testing-icayecrwc","summary":"Usability testing is one of the most rewarding parts of product discovery. The risks of not doing any usability testing before building a new feature or product far outweigh any short term pain. To get the most out of a usability testing session, it\u2019s important to plan what it is that you\u2019d like to test.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/ddfb784c1c4d8bcd4b14101f619d60d6","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-06T13:59:25.000Z"},{"id":"hseVih20Y","title":"How to Conduct